  "code": "1164",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<p><strong data-start=\"117\" data-end=\"140\">Non-HDL cholesterol</strong> represents the <strong data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"206\">total amount of atherogenic (bad) lipoproteins</strong> in the blood.</p>\n<p data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"320\">It includes:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"448\">\n<li data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"352\">\n<p data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"352\">LDL (low-density lipoprotein)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"390\">\n<p data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"390\">VLDL (very-low-density lipoprotein)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"431\">\n<p data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"431\">IDL (intermediate-density lipoprotein)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"448\">\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"448\">Lipoprotein(a)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"479\">🩺 <strong data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"479\">Clinical significance:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"664\">\n<li data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"555\">\n<p data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"555\">A better predictor of <strong data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"527\">cardiovascular risk</strong> than LDL cholesterol alone.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"664\">\n<p data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"664\">Especially useful in individuals with <strong data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"608\">diabetes</strong>, <strong data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"632\">metabolic syndrome</strong>, or <strong data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"663\">elevated triglycerides</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Non-HDL Cholesterol</strong></th>\n<th><strong>Interpretation</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt; 130 mg/dL</td>\n<td><strong>Desirable</strong> (Low cardiovascular risk)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>130&ndash;159 mg/dL</td>\n<td>Borderline high</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>160&ndash;189 mg/dL</td>\n<td>High risk</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&ge; 190 mg/dL</td>\n<td><strong>Very high risk</strong> &ndash; aggressive treatment often needed</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
